<title>USA: Conseco completes Pioneer Financial merger.</title>
<headline>Conseco completes Pioneer Financial merger.</headline>
<dateline>CARMEL, Ind. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conseco Inc said Friday it completed its merger with Pioneer Financial Services Inc, making Pioneer a wholly owned subsidiary of Conseco.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the previously announced merger, each outstanding share of Pioneer common stock was converted into 0.7077 Conseco share.</p>
<p>Conseco is a financial services organization.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
